---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Venue & Travel">
	<h2>Getting To BIP</h2>
	<p>
		The address is <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/L7ha2Umnv863WpuK7"
			>Yarnfield Park, ST15 0NL</a
		>. There is plenty of free parking for those travelling by car.</p
	>
	<p>
		The main railway station is Stafford, 9 miles from the venue. Stone
		Station is 3 miles away, but has limited connections. If you are
		travelling by train and would like a lift to the venue, post your train
		arrival time in the <a
			href="https://spond.com/client/sponds/9FFABA324287461392ACE5F1557E6CEC"
			>SPOND event page</a
		> and ask if anyone who is driving can swing by to pick you up.
	</p>
	<p>
		Local taxi firms: <ul>
			<li>
				Star Private Hire: <a href="tel:+441785822822">01785 822822</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				A Cabs Taxis: <a href="tel:+441785501804">01785 501804</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</p>
	<h2>Check-in and Check-out</h2>
	<p>
		Check-in is available from 4pm. A welfare rep will be on the welcome
		desk with a printed name badge for you to wear throughout the weekend.
	</p><p
		>You must check out by 10am on Sunday — before you go to the first
		workshop of the day! Please check out of your room after breakfast. Put
		your bags in your car or store with reception.
	</p>
	<h2>Food and Drink</h2>
	<p>
		Meal times are:
		<ul>
			<li>07:00–08:30 breakfast</li>
			<li>12:30–13.30 lunch</li>
			<li>18:00–19:30 dinner</li>
		</ul>
		Food is all served buffet style. Dietary requests have been passed onto the
		hotel, but please make yourself known to the kitchen staff for your individual
		preferences.
	</p>
	<p>
		Coffees and teas and coffees are available throughout the day with
		non-dairy milk alternatives on offer.
	</p>
	<p>
		During the evening, the venue bar sells a range of alcoholic and soft
		drinks. If you are bringing your own alcohol, please drink it discreetly
		and clean up any empty bottles or cans after you&apos;ve finished.
	</p>
	<h2>Other Amenities</h2>
	<p
		>The venue has free wifi — ask for details on check-in. There is a gym
		if you have the energy. Find out more on the <a
			href="https://www.yarnfieldpark.com"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>Yarnfield Park website</a
		>
	</p>
</Layout>
